<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>1986 Death Files | Matrix Reprogrammed</title><meta name="description" content="High-profile deaths and living evidence dossiers for 1986."/><meta property="og:title" content="1986 Death Files | Matrix Reprogrammed"/><meta property="og:description" content="High-profile deaths and living evidence dossiers for 1986."/><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="fixes.css"/></head><body><canvas id="matrix"></canvas><div class="signal-face"></div><div class="veil"></div><div class="page"><header class="wrap topbar"><a class="brand" href="index.html"><img src="sigil.png" alt="Matrix Reprogrammed sigil"/> MATRIX REPROGRAMMED</a><nav class="nav"><a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="death-files.html">Death Files</a><a href="investigation-machine.html">Investigations</a><a href="epstein-files.html">Epstein</a><a href="tracker-dashboard.html">Trackers</a><a href="source-document-vault.html">Sources</a><a href="forum.html">Signal Boards</a><a href="search.html">Search</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero wrap death-year-hero"><div class="eyebrow">The Death Files · Year Archive</div><h1>1986</h1><p class="lead">The people, official accounts, evidence trails, consequences, and unanswered questions that remain attached to this year.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="death-files.html#year-archive">All Years</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-files-pattern-lab.html">Pattern Lab</a></div></section><section class="section wrap"><h2>Dossiers</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="barry-seal"><span class="label">1986 · Informant · Organised crime</span><h3>Barry Seal</h3><p>Seal had become a federal informant with knowledge of major cocaine networks, covert operations, and politically explosive allegations. His death ended a high-value testimony channel and intensified controversy over covert operations and drug trafficking.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>19 Feb 1986</span><span>Baton Rouge, Louisiana, United States</span><span>Homicide</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-barry-seal.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-barry-seal.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="olof-palme"><span class="label">1986 · Political leader · Unsolved assassination</span><h3>Olof Palme</h3><p>Palme was an internationally active social-democratic leader who opposed apartheid, criticised both superpowers, and supported disarmament and Third World causes. The assassination transformed Swedish security culture and remains a major unresolved historical trauma.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>28 Feb 1986</span><span>Stockholm, Sweden</span><span>Homicide</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-olof-palme.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-olof-palme.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="michele-sindona"><span class="label">1986 · Banker · Poisoning</span><h3>Michele Sindona</h3><p>Sindona possessed detailed knowledge of Vatican-linked finance, political corruption, P2, Mafia capital, and bank failures. His death closed a central witness channel in Italy&#39;s hidden-finance scandals.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>22 Mar 1986</span><span>Voghera, Italy</span><span>Disputed poisoning in prison</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-michele-sindona.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-michele-sindona.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="samora-machel"><span class="label">1986 · Political leader · Aircraft crash</span><h3>Samora Machel</h3><p>Machel led a frontline state supporting anti-apartheid movements and resisting South African regional dominance. His death changed Mozambique&#39;s leadership and regional balance during the final apartheid decade.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>19 Oct 1986</span><span>Mbuzini, South Africa</span><span>Accident in official commission; sabotage allegations unresolved</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-samora-machel.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-samora-machel.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article></div></section><section class="section wrap"><h2>Year Pattern Boundary</h2><article class="card"><p>Shared dates, institutions, investigators, lawyers, beneficiaries, or security failures are leads for comparison. A pattern does not establish coordination.</p></article></section><script type="application/json" id="compatibility-marker-vault" data-cleanup-marker="deep-cleanup">{"status":"compatibility-routes-preserved-with-clean-public-copy","checked":"2026-07-27","routes":["downloads/forum-posts.json","downloads/forum-posts.md","feed-center.html","share-center.html","launch-room.html","offer-center.html","source-document-vault.html","evidence-vault.html","black-file.html"]}</script></main><footer class="footer wrap"><p><strong>THE DEATH FILES</strong> — evidence first, conclusion second.</p><p class="warning">Inclusion does not imply murder, conspiracy, or wrongdoing by any connected person. Official findings, established evidence, disputed claims, analytical inference, and speculation are displayed separately.</p></footer></div><script src="matrix.js"></script><script src="death-f